Error [E0135]: `12` is outside `Severity`'s range 0..10
  --> tests/ui/range_type_literal_out_of_bounds.jet:4:21
    |
  4 |     sev :: Severity(12)
    |                     ^^
 Why: a range type only holds values inside its bounds; `12` can never be a `Severity`
 Fix: use a value in `0..10`, or widen the type's range
